<codeline><highlight class="normal">[//]:<sp/>#<sp/>&quot;Short<sp/>Description:<sp/>Device<sp/>HALT<sp/>Mode<sp/>and<sp/>Wakeup<sp/>using<sp/>GPIO&quot;</highlight></codeline>
